version: 1
title: Bygone 0.7 — from visual comparison to explainable review
sourceUrl: https://github.com/davidmashburn/bygone/compare/v0.6.3...a18023f
range:
  base: ba0509e450e399eec7c8a3e660ac940649f4379d
  head: a18023f209a7016545108f18048ef2dd7bd94292

